{"id":"vod_sn_36618","vodId":"36618","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"人鱼之森","name_cn":"人鱼之森","date":"1991-01-01","year":"1991","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ceee6c5cf865718e6c3f30a03ccedf74.jpg"},"summary":"在传说中，人鱼的肉是众人趋之若鹜的珍贵药材，凡是食用它的人，即可获得永生不死的荣耀。在一次偶然中，渔夫涌太（山寺宏一 配音）和伙伴们捕获了一奇怪的肉块，鬼使神差中，三人分食了此物，不久之后，其中的两人暴毙，而不知是幸运还是不幸，从这天起，幸存下来的涌太成为了不死之人。经过了几百年是世事变迁，涌太终于无法忍受独活的孤独和寂寞，他决定走遍世界各地，发誓要找到解除永生诅咒的方法。　　在世界的某处，被村人监禁的名叫真鱼（高山南 配音）的女子在姥姥的哄骗下吃下了人鱼的肉。涌太和真鱼，当两人相遇时，命运之轮开始转动，两个背负着永生罪孽的人，踏上了充满危险和死亡的逃亡道路。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZVSNsxEUee1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CXzHwAVhza1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gjBfHGrmmu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gH3QnzRH7r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XwdAU5dfr61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L6cKKbB11H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cn2XQGQM5e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y19t67DByR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UKMwefH6AV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HRVvsZDCXz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HrR50y4UwG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dsAyG4RHBd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/br078CLgbY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YfrGpk95Sq1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt"